/T (Members of the Bionic Prosthetics & Orthotics Group team recently attended OTWorld 2026 in Leipzig, Germany, one of the world's premier events focused on prosthetics, orthotics, rehabilitation, and mobility technology. The conference brought together industry leaders, clinicians, researchers, and manufacturers from around the world to share the latest advancements in patient care, emerging technologies, and innovative clinical solutions.)
/E (Members of the Bionic Prosthetics & Orthotics Group team recently attended OTWorld 2026 in Leipzig, Germany, one of the world's premier events focused on prosthetics, orthotics, rehabilitation, and mobility technology. The conference brought together industry leaders, clinicians, researchers, and manufacturers from around the world to share the latest advancements in patient care, emerging technologies, and innovative clinical solutions.)
