/S /H1
/P 117 0 R
/T (Throughout the week, our team explored developments in digital workflows, 3D printing, artificial intelligence, advanced prosthetic and orthotic systems, and rehabilitation technologies. The experience provided valuable opportunities to collaborate with global partners, evaluate new solutions, and identify ideas that can further enhance patient outcomes and clinical excellence across Bionic. We look forward to bringing these insights back to our clinics as we continue advancing the future of mobility and patient care.)
